  "title": "Deep dive into GROOT N1.5: A Foundation Model for Generalist Humanoid Robots",
  "summary": "Today, we dive into GROOT N1.5, the latest iteration of NVIDIA’s open foundation model for generalist humanoid robots. NVIDIA has shared limited details about GROOT N1.5. That said, the model builds closely on the foundation of its predecessor, GROOT N1, retaining many similarities in its core design",
